<description>&lt;p&gt;Communal clashes continue as SPLA-IO forces retook Akobo and SSPDF soldiers were wounded in an assault on a Mundri West military outpost, while fighting in Unity State raised the death toll to 29 and SSPDF reported 40 deaths in Rumbek clashes, contradicting a ministry figure of 71. A high court sentenced five officers to 24 years for raiding a general's home and a pastor received death threats in a refugee camp. The EU and Germany-funded SGBV prevention project concluded after four years, ASK Foundation and German doctors began free cleft surgery for 20 children in Juba, and South Sudan urged vigilance after Ebola outbreaks in neighboring DRC and Uganda. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPV3c5dVRRcDBQSkl3azc5Z2drTTFlMjFCYllTY3ZTY0JST3g0bjlVb2VKYkRzMHdwbkNuZXVDTUJ2ZkNCS1FBeERoMFh5UUo5cFBCdTMyWmVBQlE1Slp5M251SEhjV0hkbk9lMFdrSDFOMWlOY1pnQmFvaEJXaEExaTdmSjhLdVpRblp4YU5paWc0VzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOM0YtNEVQN1RvMDA3R2NJR3JtV2ZvVGpZR3dZWHhEdFpDS29rOTBXU1hhdWp1alVHSFJlcHpYNlhqOElJVTlGT0pwRE9jdndScEp5a1pwUDNmaXcwcnlYVWpxb1VKOFh1VFFpbFoxYnRsa3R5VkhVa1pwV0JDV1NYY0xvUmpCNU1nSWxQYkNMQTdCM2Q4Zm5qSjVmVXE?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNZ0l1NTJiOUtkUkIxSE52U1gzM0syMDBkamNBa2g2QmFhU3o2QzQxVUl0T3U1THpMUjNQUmpkV1ppNzlUUWo4eksyWnYtVVc0ZkEya0E2cE9jck1CakVZT29VUm9RRm13S0RYNDk1NU5UdTRHY1pUT0cxMl9ITy1OdmEzWlNpVmNvYmw2LQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pulitzer Center&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQSzdWOFExWmRkUEwxWDA5QnlEQ0xzdzUxaG5ZcUJYUzdlcnpPQk4tdnhFMDQzVjhqblRhV2Nta0o2dm42cTVYdmJVLUhfNi05SjhjUzRhUy0zQ1J4Z0hKRmo1ZEoyYlQtZ3k2MnBTWVBhb2lXa0xx